end":158,"person_id":"v5s_1ew_vh0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-chenggong-jian:p001:m0160","surface":"晞","start":160,"end":161,"person_id":"v5s_1ew_vh0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-chenggong-jian","book_id":"b-jinshu-061","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-061-chenggong-jian-ws7903772"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p020","text":"馥字祖宣，浚從父弟也。父蕤，安平太守。馥少與友人成公簡齊名，俱起家為諸王文學，累遷司徒左西屬。司徒王渾表「馥理識清正，兼有才幹，主定九品，檢括精詳。臣委任責成，褒貶允當，請補尚書郎」。許之。稍遷司徒左長史、吏部郎，選舉精密，論望益美。轉御史中丞、侍中，拜徐州刺史，加冠軍將軍、假節。徵為廷尉。","source_position":{"raw_start":3286,"raw_end":3434,"raw_text":"　　馥字祖宣，浚從父弟也。父蕤，安平太守。馥少與友人成公簡齊名，俱起家為諸王文學，累遷司徒左西屬。司徒王渾表「馥理識清正，兼有才幹，主定九品，檢括精詳。臣委任責成，褒貶允當，請補尚書郎」。許之。稍遷司徒左長史、吏部郎，選舉精密，論望益美。轉御史中丞、侍中，拜徐州刺史，加冠軍將軍、假節。徵為廷尉。","display_wrapper_start":0,"display_wrapper_end":0,"raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-7903772-raw.wikitext"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p020:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"馥","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_BA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"076王廙元帝鎮江左、討周馥脈絡與本段相合；不是只從單字馥匹配韓馥。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p020:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"祖宣","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_BA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"076王廙元帝鎮江左、討周馥脈絡與本段相合；不是只從單字馥匹配韓馥。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p020:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"浚","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"069明顗為安東將軍浚子；本061同父官與三子顗嵩謨脈絡合，與042伐吳周浚亦同事件。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p020:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"蕤","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p020:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"馥","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_BA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"076王廙元帝鎮江左、討周馥脈絡與本段相合；不是只從單字馥匹配韓馥。"},{"id":"c-jin